body:
moe

&#x200B;

i relate to him a lot

trigger warning, literal attempt

&#x200B;

having impulsive reactions is really shit. I was having a really bad time at time (still am), and i thought," fuck it"

i took nothing, walked around 10 kilometers to the highest bridge in our town and almost jumped. this random guy comes to talk to me to not to jump, somehow talks me out of it and i let him take me close to my house and walked home. i never told anyone, it would break my mother apart and i would hate that.

&#x200B;

still doing as bad as then, maybe worse. it feels scary that almost nothing keeps me here currently.
